units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p s
lattice bcc 3.3
region whole block 0 66 0 66 0 213 units box
create_box 1 whole
region target block 0 66 0 66 0 132 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
region projectile block 0 66 0 66 147 213 units box
create_atoms 1 region projectile
group target region target
group projectile region projectile
mass 1 92.906
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step time temp etotal press
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix 1
velocity projectile add 0 0 -20 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
run 100000
